DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       pam_faildelay is a PAM module that can be used to set the delay on
       failure per-application.

       If no ddeellaayy is given, pam_faildelay will use the value of FAIL_DELAY
       from /etc/login.defs.

