       ddeebbuugg
           Turns on debugging messages sent to syslog.

       ddeellaayy==_N
           Set the delay on failure to N microseconds.

MMOODDUULLEE TTYYPPEESS PPRROOVVIIDDEEDD
       Only the aauutthh module type is provided.

RREETTUURRNN VVAALLUUEESS
       PAM_IGNORE
           Delay was successful adjusted.

       PAM_SYSTEM_ERR
           The specified delay was not valid.

EEXXAAMMPPLLEESS
       The following example will set the delay on failure to 10 seconds:

           auth  optional  pam_faildelay.so  delay=10000000



